    "Home に次の目標を表示" : {
      "comment" : "Settings toggle: show Home's one next-target line of the Weight Journey (重さの旅), the next milestone marker (一里塚) or landmark (名所). Suggested en: 'Show the next goal on Home'",
      "localizations" : {
