    "「%@」だけを削除します。%@と質量は消えず、現在の名前と色も残ります。この操作は取り消せません。" : {
      "comment" : "Theme deletion alert message. The first argument is the theme name, the second how many past records use it (過去の記録3件)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Only the theme “%1$@” will be deleted. Its mass and its %2$@ are not deleted and still show its current name and color. This can't be undone."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%@」だけを削除します。%@と質量は消えず、現在の名前と色も残ります。この操作は取り消せません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
