    "自動では再開しません。アプリに戻って「再開する」をタップすると、離れた時点の続きから進みます。休憩中と、終了まで%@以内の集中は止めません。オフのときは、アプリを離れてもタイマーは止まりません。" : {
      "comment" : "Settings footer under the leave-pause switch: how the timer resumes, what is never paused, and the off state. The argument is the final stretch that is never paused (1分). Suggested English: The timer never resumes by itself. Go back to the app and tap Resume to continue from where you left. Breaks and the last %@ of a focus are never paused. When off, the timer keeps running after you leave the app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The timer never resumes on its own. Go back to the app and tap “Resume” to continue from where you left off. Breaks, and a focus with %@ or less to go, are never paused. When this is off, the timer keeps running when you leave the app."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自動では再開しません。アプリに戻って「再開する」をタップすると、離れた時点の続きから進みます。休憩中と、終了まで%@以内の集中は止めません。オフのときは、アプリを離れてもタイマーは止まりません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "自己申告を含める" : {
      "comment" : "Settings switch: include self-reported gems in shares",
      "localizations" : {
